{"id":"131c12339265da2a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/592_多主体信念逻辑_KD_45_n.md","title":"592 多主体信念逻辑 KD 45 n","display":"592_多主体信念逻辑_KD_45_n","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a&lt;n\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a&lt;n\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},B_a\">\\(\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},B_a\\)</span>；原子公式直接由命题变元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}\\)</span> 充当，不另设带标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}\\)</span> 构造子。显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_aA\">\\(B_aA\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(B_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(B_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(B_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{592}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{592})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{592}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{592})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{592}^{n}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{592}^{n}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,592}^{n}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,592}^{n}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{592}^{n}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{592})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{592}^{n}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{592})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{592}^{n}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{592}^{n}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{592}^{n}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{592}^{n}\\)</span>，替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}\\)</span> 由下列子句给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(B_aA,\\sigma)=B_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(B_aA,\\sigma)=B_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{592,n}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{592,n}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{592,n}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{592,n}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{592,n}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{592,n}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{592,n}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{592,n}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&lt;n\">\\(a&lt;n\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{592,n}=\\{B_a(A\\to C)\\to(B_aA\\to B_aC):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{592,n}=\\{B_a(A\\to C)\\to(B_aA\\to B_aC):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D,a}^{592,n}=\\{B_aA\\to\\neg B_a\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D,a}^{592,n}=\\{B_aA\\to\\neg B_a\\neg A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{592,n}=\\{B_aA\\to B_aB_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{592,n}=\\{\\neg B_aA\\to B_a\\neg B_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{592,n}=\\{B_aA\\to B_aB_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{592,n}=\\{\\neg B_aA\\to B_a\\neg B_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{592}^{n}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{592,n}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a&lt;n}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D,a}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{592,n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{592}^{n}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{592,n}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a&lt;n}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D,a}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{592,n}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{592,n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{592,n}=\\{((A,A\\to C),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{592,n}=\\{((A),B_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{592,n}=\\{((A,A\\to C),C):A,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{592,n}=\\{((A),B_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to C}{C}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B_aA}\\ (Nec_a).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to C}{C}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B_aA}\\ (Nec_a).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{592}^{n}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{592,n}\\cup\\bigcup_{a&lt;n}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{592,n}\n\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{592}^{n}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{592,n}\\cup\\bigcup_{a&lt;n}\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{592,n}\n\\subseteq(\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n})^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{592}^{n}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{592}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\)</span>，并且每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{592}^{n}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{592}^{n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{592,n}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{592,n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{592,n}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{592,n}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{592}^{n}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{592}^{n}(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m})=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{592}^{n}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{592}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{592}^{n}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{592}^{n}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{592}^{n}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{592}^{n}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{592}^{n}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{592}^{n}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{592}^{n}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{592}^{n}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-主体信念证书\">8. 主体信念证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"592\">\\(592\\)</span>-主体信念证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CertTag}_{592}=\\{\\mathsf{D},\\mathsf{4},\\mathsf{5}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CertTag}_{592}=\\{\\mathsf{D},\\mathsf{4},\\mathsf{5}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{592}^{n}={}&amp;\n\\{(a,\\mathsf{D},A,B_aA\\to\\neg B_a\\neg A):a&lt;n,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{4},A,B_aA\\to B_aB_aA):a&lt;n,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{5},A,\\neg B_aA\\to B_a\\neg B_aA):a&lt;n,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{592}^{n}={}&amp;\n\\{(a,\\mathsf{D},A,B_aA\\to\\neg B_a\\neg A):a&lt;n,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{4},A,B_aA\\to B_aB_aA):a&lt;n,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(a,\\mathsf{5},A,\\neg B_aA\\to B_a\\neg B_aA):a&lt;n,A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个互不混同的信念构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_a\">\\(B_a\\)</span>；不同主体之间没有公共信念或群体信念构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{KD45N}_{592}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n},\\mathsf{Prop}_{592},\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n},\\operatorname{BV}_{592}^{n},\\equiv_{\\alpha,592}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{592}^{n},\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{592}^{n},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{592,n},(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{592,n})_{a&lt;n},\\mathsf{Rule}_{592}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{592}^{n},\\operatorname{last}_{592}^{n},\\vdash_{592}^{n},\\mathsf{Thm}_{592}^{n},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{592},\\mathsf{Cert}_{592}^{n}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{KD45N}_{592}\n=\n\\bigl(\nn,\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n},\\mathsf{Prop}_{592},\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n},\\operatorname{BV}_{592}^{n},\\equiv_{\\alpha,592}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{592}^{n},\\operatorname{Sub}_{592}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{592}^{n},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{592,n},(\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec,a}^{592,n})_{a&lt;n},\\mathsf{Rule}_{592}^{n},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{592}^{n},\\operatorname{last}_{592}^{n},\\vdash_{592}^{n},\\mathsf{Thm}_{592}^{n},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{592},\\mathsf{Cert}_{592}^{n}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含多主体信念逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含知识、公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 或动态修正。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-主体信念证书","text":"8. 主体信念证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-整个句法形式系统","text":"10. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"n>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}=\\{a\\in\\mathbb N:a<n\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i<k\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},B_a","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}","display":false},{"tex":"B_aA","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{592}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"B_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{592}^{n}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{592}^{n}\\to\\mathcal